#: scenario8:scenario8_E068E5DB_83F5_4BD0_A410_4BEE5091C262
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2e7e0cf6dae6f11a6e7e603d81c95fdc7a70164e8565a9436ba4b59927d0d5c3
