"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫H-⟪k:2⟫Hey, now! No cuttin’ in line, young man!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫We been waitin’ since dawn!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫E-⟪k:2⟫Ei, vamo lá! Não corta a fila, meu jovem!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Tamo esperando desde o "
"amanhece!"

